{{JPExclusive}}
'''Sho Ayanokoji''' (綾小路 翔 ''Ayanokōji Shō''), often styled as '''Show Ayanocozey''', is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in the [[Kishidan Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Sho Ayanokoji
|image = E 141.png
|appearance = [[Kishidan Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 460円 - 1,817円
}}

==Enemy==
The hardest enemy out of them all in the [[Kishidan Collaboration Event|Kishidan Collaboration]]. He has mediocre range, but boasts massive health and very high damage which makes him very difficult to neutralize.

==Strategies==
This enemy appears to be intimidating, but isn't as dangerous as he seems to be due to his [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] trait which opens up possibilities for a wide variety of anti-Red specialists.

