==Trivia==
*Amongst the members of [[Kishidan Collaboration Event|Kishidan]], Sho Ayanokoji's signature color is red (as opposed to [[Hikaru Saotome (Special Cat)|Hikaru]]'s blue, [[Hitomi Saionji (Special Cat)|Tommy]]'s purple, etc.), hence why he is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy.
*Sho Ayanokoji was originally a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]]/Red enemy. This seems to have been changed some time after [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

